        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The fog leans in and starts eating minds. Every creature in the Miasma's space rolls vs Resolve (DC 18) or collapses into dreaming — helpless and unconscious for a minute, waking early only if damaged or shaken awake by an ally's action. For each dreamer it takes, the Miasma regains 15 Integrity. The dreams are not restful.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
      "effects": [],
